WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:03.410
Which SCP would be the best Secret Santa gift
giver?

00:00:03.410 --> 00:00:06.589
Definitely not SCP-096.

00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:13.550
We think the answer is actually pretty obvious:
SCP-4666, also known as The Yule Man.

00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:17.870
The Yule Man absolutely loves giving gifts,
and he knows that children will love his gifts

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:21.000
because they’re made both by and of children!

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.820
He’ll give you great Secret Santa presents
like a drum made of human skin, a knife carved

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:30.369
from a child’s bones, a soccer ball made
out of a human face, and even a hairbrush

00:00:30.369 --> 00:00:32.189
made from human teeth!

00:00:32.189 --> 00:00:34.500
Nobody brings the party like the Yule Man!

